{"id": "1540475982031491112", "channel_id": "1540475982031491112", "author_id": "387716481896415232", "author_name": "ambir3", "content": "Hi! I usually read stage achievements before going into a battle just in case I need to switch up my team.\n\nUsually I go with mouchette, aigis, thais, helot. However upon seeing this quest I switched to my shielding team but couldn’t beat it in 2 tries, so I decided to just clear it with my main team and get the achievement later.\n\nHowever upon clearing the stage I realized I did actually get the achievement. But looking at the stats there is no turn where I got more than 60% shielding (my total hp is around 400 so I would need more than 200 shield but my highest was 67).\n\nSo is it just that the “1 turn” actually counts the entire run? Or did the achievement count the failed runs I did? (I got over 100% shielding on my shield team but I died and retreated)\n\nSorry for the lengthy text, appreciate the help!", "timestamp": "2026-08-21T21:41:34.776000+00:00", "thread_id": "1540475982031491112", "attachments": [{"id": "1540475982341734470", "filename": "IMG_4524.png", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 341958, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1540475982031491112/1540475982341734470/IMG_4524.png?ex=6a8a178e&is=6a88c60e&hm=dd07d3cb500fa810502029cde8971c1533cf053bf671dbcf8e47125a2125c313&"}, {"id": "1540475982732066917", "filename": "IMG_4523.png", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 244833, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1540475982031491112/1540475982732066917/IMG_4523.png?ex=6a8a178e&is=6a88c60e&hm=290913fd11b4e56c52e59f9f3aec9d4a6b4025c75e52c383bcbfc219f71c2849&"}], "thread_title": "Confused on Stage Achievement", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747463379390545"], "is_thread_starter": true}
